//WWW.GMOWNERCENTER.COM<\/A> .","park":false},{"camp":"08V616000","comp":null,"sum":"GM IS RECALLING 2,149 MY 2009 SATURN VUE VEHICLES.  SOME OF THESE VEHICLES MAY HAVE BEEN BUILT WITH AN INCORRECT RIGHT AND/OR LEFT FRONT STEERING KNUCKLE.  AS A RESULT OF THE INCORRECT KNUCKLE AND RESULTING INADEQUATE CLEARANCE, THE TIE ROD BALL STUD COULD PULL OUT OF, OR FRACTURE, THE TIE ROD HOUSING.  THIS COULD CAUSE THE TIE ROD TO SEPARATE FROM THE KNUCKLE.","remedy":"DEALERS WILL INSPECT THE STEERING KNUCKLES AND, IF NECESSARY, REPLACE THE STEERING KNUCKLE(S) AND TIE ROD(S).  THE RECALL BEGAN ON DECEMBER 8, 2008.  OWNERS MAY CONTACT SATURN AT 1-800-972-8876 OR THROUGH THEIR WEBSITE AT <A HREF=HTTP://WWW.GMOWNERCENTER.COM>HTTP://WWW.GMOWNERCENTER.COM<\/A> .","park":false}],"mpg":[{"city":27,"hwy":30,"comb":28,"cost":1550,"eng":"3.6","trans":"Automatic (variable gear ratios)","drive":"Front-Wheel Drive","range":null,"mpge":null},{"city":19,"hwy":26,"comb":22,"cost":2000,"eng":"2.4","trans":"Automatic 4-spd","drive":"Front-Wheel Drive","range":null,"mpge":null},{"city":17,"hwy":24,"comb":19,"cost":2300,"eng":"3.6","trans":"Automatic 6-spd","drive":"Front-Wheel Drive","range":null,"mpge":null},{"city":17,"hwy":24,"comb":19,"cost":2300,"eng":"3.6","trans":"Automatic (S6)","drive":"Front-Wheel Drive","range":null,"mpge":null},{"city":25,"hwy":32,"comb":28,"cost":1550,"eng":"2.4","trans":"Automatic 4-spd","drive":"Front-Wheel Drive","range":null,"mpge":null},{"city":16,"hwy":23,"comb":18,"cost":2450,"eng":"3.5","trans":"Automatic 6-spd","drive":"4-Wheel or All-Wheel Drive","range":null,"mpge":null},{"city":16,"hwy":23,"comb":18,"cost":2450,"eng":"3.6","trans":"Automatic 6-spd","drive":"4-Wheel or All-Wheel Drive","range":null,"mpge":null},{"city":16,"hwy":23,"comb":18,"cost":2450,"eng":"3.6","trans":"Automatic (S6)","drive":"4-Wheel or All-Wheel Drive","range":null,"mpge":null}],"safety":{"overall":null,"front_d":5,"front_p":5,"side_d":5,"side_p":5,"rollover":4,"roll_pct":0.159,"pole"